["Requires the Barrens oasis quest chain. Complete The Barrens Oases, The Forgotten Pools, The Stagnant Oasis and Altered Beings, then Hamuul Runetotem and Nara Wildmane before Leaders of the Fang becomes available."]="Richiede la catena di missioni delle oasi delle Savane. Completa The Barrens Oases, The Forgotten Pools, The Stagnant Oasis e Altered Beings, poi Hamuul Runetotem e Nara Wildmane prima che Leaders of the Fang diventi disponibile.",
