["Nostro's Compendium of Dragon Slaying - Loot from Tsu'zee, Prince Tortheldrin, Magister Kalendris, Illyanna Ravenoak, Tendris Warpwood, A Dusty Tome, A Dusty Tome and other enemies. Right-click the item to begin."]="Nostro's Compendium of Dragon Slaying - 从苏斯、托塞德林王子、卡雷迪斯镇长、伊琳娜·暗木、特迪斯·扭木、A Dusty Tome、A Dusty Tome及其他敌人身上拾取。右键点击该物品开始任务。",
["Nostro's Compendium of Dragon Slaying book"]="Nostro's Compendium of Dragon Slaying（书籍）",
["Obtain Omarion's Handbook from Master Craftsman Omarion inside Naxxramas, then right-click it and deliver to Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel. Opens Wilhelm's frost-resistance armor exchanges."]="从纳克萨玛斯内的大工匠奥玛里恩处获得Omarion's Handbook，右键点击后交给圣光之愿礼拜堂的工匠威尔海姆。开启威尔海姆的冰霜抗性护甲兑换。",
