["One-time bijou introduction. Bring any colored Hakkari Bijou from Zul'Gurub to the Altar of Zanza on Yojamba Isle and destroy it there. Later bijou destructions are an altar interaction, not separate quests for each color."]="一次性的比修入门任务。将任意颜色的哈卡莱比修从祖尔格拉布带到尤亚姆巴岛上的赞扎祭坛并在那里摧毁。之后的比修摧毁属于祭坛互动，而不是每种颜色各自独立的任务。",
["Optional Zul'Gurub story introduction following the Yeh'kinya / Mosh'aru tablet chain. It is not required to enter Zul'Gurub or to take the other Zandalar quests."]="可选的祖尔格拉布剧情引导任务，接续叶基亚 / Mosh'aru石板任务链。进入祖尔格拉布或接取其他赞达拉任务不需要完成此任务。",
["Optional explanatory dialogue about the priest challenge. It is not a required completion before accepting The Balance of Light and Shadow."]="关于牧师挑战的可选说明对话。接受The Balance of Light and Shadow之前无需完成。",
["Optional introductory quest:"]="可选的引导任务：",
["Optional quiver branch. Mature Blue Dragon Sinew drops from Azuregos, with a rare alternative drop from elite blue dragonkin in Winterspring. This is separate from the bow/string tasks."]="可选的箭袋分支。Mature Blue Dragon Sinew由艾索雷葛斯掉落，冬泉谷的精英蓝龙也有较低几率掉落。此分支与弓/弓弦任务相互独立。",
