["Paladin class quest for humans and dwarves. In this dungeon: Jordan's Smithing Hammer is picked up from the object Jordan's Hammer in the courtyard. The other parts are Whitestone Oak Lumber (The Deadmines), the Kor Gem (Blackfathom Deeps) and Jordan's ore shipment (Loch Modan)."]="人类和矮人圣骑士职业任务。在此地下城中：Jordan's Smithing Hammer可从庭院中的物品Jordan's Hammer处拾取。其他部件为Whitestone Oak Lumber（死亡矿井）、Kor Gem（黑暗深渊）和乔丹的矿石货物（洛克莫丹）。",
["Paladin class quest for humans and dwarves. In this dungeon: Whitestone Oak Lumber drops from Goblin Woodcarvers. The other parts are Jordan's Smithing Hammer (Shadowfang Keep), the Kor Gem (Blackfathom Deeps) and Jordan's ore shipment (Loch Modan)."]="人类和矮人圣骑士职业任务。在此地下城中：Whitestone Oak Lumber由地精木雕师掉落。其他部件为Jordan's Smithing Hammer（影牙城堡）、Kor Gem（黑暗深渊）和乔丹的矿石货物（洛克莫丹）。",
["Paladin class quest for humans and dwarves. In this dungeon: the Corrupted Kor Gem drops from Blackfathom Sea Witches inside, and from Blackfathom Tide Priestesses and Oracles at the entrance in Ashenvale. Thundris Windweaver in Auberdine purifies it. The other parts are Whitestone Oak Lumber (The Deadmines), Jordan's Smithing Hammer (Shadowfang Keep) and Jordan's ore shipment (Loch Modan)."]="人类和矮人圣骑士职业任务。在此地下城中：Corrupted Kor Gem由副本内的黑暗深渊海巫掉落，也可由灰谷入口处的黑暗深渊潮汐女祭司和神谕者掉落。奥伯丁的桑迪斯·织风可以将其净化。其他部件为Whitestone Oak Lumber（死亡矿井）、Jordan's Smithing Hammer（影牙城堡）和乔丹的矿石货物（洛克莫丹）。",
["Parqual Fintallas, Undercity"]="帕科瓦·芬塔拉斯, 幽暗城",
["Part of the chain that begins with The Unsent Letter from Edwin VanCleef in The Deadmines."]="属于从死亡矿井中艾德温·范克里夫的The Unsent Letter开始的任务链。",
