["Priest epic chain: equip The Eye of Divinity from Majordomo's Cache of the Firelord to see Eris. Save 50 peasants before 15 die; do the event without outside assistance. Combine the reward Splinter of Nordrassil with The Eye of Divinity and The Eye of Shadow to create Benediction, which can transform into Anathema. These staves are created by combining items, not direct quest rewards."]="牧师史诗任务链：装备从管理者的火焰之王的宝箱中获得的The Eye of Divinity以看到艾瑞斯。在15名农民死亡之前拯救50名农民；在没有外部协助的情况下完成事件。将奖励Splinter of Nordrassil与The Eye of Divinity和The Eye of Shadow合成为祈福，它可以转换为咒逐。这些法杖由物品合成获得，并非任务的直接奖励。",
