["Repeatable hand-in; not a daily."]="可重复上交；非每日任务。",
["Repeatable hand-in; not a daily. Loot Ancient Qiraji Artifact from AQ40 enemies, right-click it and return it to Andorgos. A repeatable reputation hand-in, separate from armor-token quests."]="可重复上交；非每日任务。从AQ40的敌人身上拾取Ancient Qiraji Artifact，右键点击后交还给安多葛斯。可重复的声望上交任务，与护甲兑换物任务相互独立。",
["Repeatable hand-in; not a daily. Repeatable follow-up to Mortal Champions. Exchange one Qiraji Lord's Insignia, looted from AQ40 bosses, for Brood of Nozdormu / Cenarion Circle reputation."]="可重复上交；非每日任务。Mortal Champions的可重复后续任务。用一枚从AQ40首领身上拾取的Qiraji Lord's Insignia兑换诺兹多姆的子嗣 / 塞纳里奥议会声望。",
["Repeatable hand-in; not a daily. Repeatable scepter-chain reputation hand-in. Completing The Path of the Righteous allows further Silithid Carapace Fragment turn-ins toward Neutral with the Brood of Nozdormu; these are not daily quests."]="可重复上交；非每日任务。权杖任务链中的可重复声望上交任务。完成The Path of the Righteous后，可继续上交Silithid Carapace Fragment，将诺兹多姆的子嗣声望提升至中立；这些不是每日任务。",
["Repeatable hand-in; not a daily. Requires Blacksmithing 300 to use Plans: Sulfuron Hammer. The quest exchanges one Sulfuron Ingot from Golemagg for those plans. Sulfuras is made by combining a crafted Sulfuron Hammer with Eye of Sulfuras from Ragnaros; there is no separate Sulfuras reward quest."]="可重复上交；非每日任务。需要锻造技能300才能使用Plans: Sulfuron Hammer。此任务用一块从古雷曼格身上获得的Sulfuron Ingot兑换该图纸。萨弗拉斯需要用制作的Sulfuron Hammer与拉格纳罗斯掉落的Eye of Sulfuras合成；没有单独的萨弗拉斯奖励任务。",
["Repeatable hand-in; not a daily. Warrior/paladin weapon use. Plant Unfired Ancient Blade for Onyxia's frontal flame, pick up Heated Ancient Blade, then use it on her corpse within its time limit. Return Treated Ancient Blade to Lydros in the Athenaeum."]="可重复上交；非每日任务。战士/圣骑士武器用途。放置Unfired Ancient Blade以承受奥妮克希亚的正面火焰，拾取Heated Ancient Blade，然后在时限内对她的尸体使用。将Treated Ancient Blade交还给Athenaeum中的莱德罗斯。",
["Requires BOTH bindings, Essence of the Firelord from Ragnaros while on this quest, and 10 Elementium Bars. Elementium Ore comes from Blackwing Lair; have a miner learn Smelt Elementium from Krixix in BWL. Turn-in summons Thunderaan in Silithus."]="需要两个禁锢之器、在此任务期间从拉格纳罗斯身上获得的Essence of the Firelord，以及10根源质锭。源质矿石来自黑翼之巢；让一名矿工在BWL向克里克西斯学习熔炼源质。交付后会在希利苏斯召唤出桑德兰。",
["Requires Exalted with Argent Dawn."]="需要银色黎明崇拜声望。",
["Requires Exalted with Argent Dawn. EXALTED alternative: free Arcane Cloaking, with no materials or gold. Complete only one reputation-based attunement."]="需要银色黎明崇拜声望。崇拜替代方案：免费获得Arcane Cloaking，无需材料或金币。只需完成一个基于声望的进入任务。",
["Requires Exalted with Brood of Nozdormu. Final Exalted Brood of Nozdormu ring for this path. Earlier Neutral/Friendly/Honored/Revered rings are in the chain. Choose one path; each upgrade consumes the preceding ring. The Changing of Paths quests are separate Exalted exchanges."]="需要诺兹多姆的子嗣崇拜声望。此路线的最终崇拜级诺兹多姆的子嗣戒指。之前的中立/友善/尊敬/崇敬戒指均在任务链中。选择一条路线；每次升级都会消耗前一枚戒指。The Changing of Paths任务是单独的崇拜级兑换。",
["Requires Exalted with Brood of Nozdormu. Repeatable hand-in; not a daily. Exalted-only path reset. Surrender the ring and the listed scarabs to abandon this path, then begin a different ring path with Anachronos. This is not another automatic ring upgrade."]="需要诺兹多姆的子嗣崇拜声望。可重复上交；非每日任务。仅限崇拜的路线重置。交出戒指和所列的甲虫以放弃此路线，然后在阿纳克洛斯处开始另一条戒指路线。这不是另一次自动的戒指升级。",
["Requires Exalted with Cenarion Circle."]="需要塞纳里奥议会崇拜声望。",
["Requires Exalted with Zandalar Tribe."]="需要赞达拉部族崇拜声望。",
["Requires Exalted with Zandalar Tribe. Repeatable hand-in; not a daily."]="需要赞达拉部族崇拜声望。可重复上交；非每日任务。",
["Requires Friendly with Brood of Nozdormu."]="需要诺兹多姆的子嗣友善声望。",
["Requires Friendly with Brood of Nozdormu. Repeatable hand-in; not a daily."]="需要诺兹多姆的子嗣友善声望。可重复上交；非每日任务。",
["Requires Friendly with Zandalar Tribe."]="需要赞达拉部族友善声望。",
["Requires Friendly with Zandalar Tribe. Repeatable hand-in; not a daily."]="需要赞达拉部族友善声望。可重复上交；非每日任务。",
["Requires Honored with Argent Dawn."]="需要银色黎明尊敬声望。",
["Requires Honored with Argent Dawn. HONORED alternative: 5 Arcane Crystals, 2 Nexus Crystals, 1 Righteous Orb and 60 gold. Complete only one reputation-based attunement; the other versions are alternatives."]="需要银色黎明尊敬声望。尊敬替代方案：5颗奥术水晶、2颗连结水晶、1颗正义宝珠和60金币。只需完成一个基于声望的进入任务；其他版本为替代方案。",
["Requires Honored with Brood of Nozdormu."]="需要诺兹多姆的子嗣尊敬声望。",
["Requires Honored with Brood of Nozdormu. Repeatable hand-in; not a daily."]="需要诺兹多姆的子嗣尊敬声望。可重复上交；非每日任务。",
["Requires Honored with Cenarion Circle."]="需要塞纳里奥议会尊敬声望。",
["Requires Honored with Hydraxian Waterlords. Requires Honored with the Hydraxian Waterlords. This is a reputation check, not another boss kill."]="需要海达希亚水元素尊敬声望。需要海达希亚水元素尊敬声望。这是声望检查，而不是另一次首领击杀。",
["Requires Honored with Zandalar Tribe."]="需要赞达拉部族尊敬声望。",
["Requires Honored with Zandalar Tribe. Repeatable hand-in; not a daily."]="需要赞达拉部族尊敬声望。可重复上交；非每日任务。",
["Requires Leatherworking 300. Leatherworking 300 only. Teaches crafting of Onyxia Scale Cloak (learned directly from this quest). The epic jewelry reward is on Celebrating Good Times."]="需要制皮技能300。仅限制皮技能300。教授制作Onyxia Scale Cloak（直接通过此任务学会）。史诗首饰奖励在Celebrating Good Times任务中。",
["Requires Leatherworking 300. Leatherworking 300 only. Teaches crafting of Onyxia Scale Cloak (learned directly from this quest). The epic jewelry reward is on For All To See."]="需要制皮技能300。仅限制皮技能300。教授制作Onyxia Scale Cloak（直接通过此任务学会）。史诗首饰奖励在For All To See任务中。",
["Requires Library, Armory and Cathedral. The Scarlet Key comes from Doan's Strongbox in Library."]="需要完成图书馆、军械库和大教堂。Scarlet Key来自图书馆中的Doan's Strongbox。",
["Requires Neutral with Brood of Nozdormu."]="需要诺兹多姆的子嗣中立声望。",
["Requires Neutral with Brood of Nozdormu. ALL required before this step: The Wrath of Neptulon; Nefarius's Corruption; The Champion Returns. Their branches may be completed in parallel."]="需要诺兹多姆的子嗣中立声望。此步骤前需全部完成：The Wrath of Neptulon；Nefarius's Corruption；The Champion Returns。这些分支可以同时进行。",
["Requires Neutral with Brood of Nozdormu. Blue scepter-shard branch. Assemble the eight chapters with Magical Book Binding. Chapters come from Doctor Weavil on Alcaz Island, Blasted Lands demons, Winterspring Hederine demons, Undercity, Stormwind, Onyxia, Blackwing Lair and Ragnaros. The Ragnaros chapter requires reaching and killing him within two hours of entering Molten Core; accept the quest before starting the raid. This book task is parallel to Narain's goggles and chicken tasks."]="需要诺兹多姆的子嗣中立声望。蓝色权杖碎片分支。用Magical Book Binding装订八个章节。章节来自奥卡兹岛的维维尔博士、诅咒之地的恶魔、冬泉谷的海德琳恶魔、幽暗城、暴风城、奥妮克希亚、黑翼之巢和拉格纳罗斯。拉格纳罗斯的章节要求在进入熔火之心后两小时内到达并击杀他；请在开始团队副本前接受任务。此书籍任务与纳瑞安的护目镜和小鸡任务同时进行。",
["Requires Neutral with Brood of Nozdormu. Blue scepter-shard branch: finish ALL THREE Narain tasks (goggles, chicken, and Draconic for Dummies), then supply the buoy materials. This is not a Blackwing Lair attunement. ALL required before this step: Scrying Goggles? No Problem!; Return to Narain; The Only Prescription. Their branches may be completed in parallel."]="需要诺兹多姆的子嗣中立声望。蓝色权杖碎片分支：完成纳瑞安的全部三个任务（护目镜、小鸡和Draconic for Dummies），然后提供浮标材料。这不是黑翼之巢的进入任务。此步骤前需全部完成：Scrying Goggles? No Problem!；Return to Narain；The Only Prescription。这些分支可以同时进行。",
["Requires Neutral with Brood of Nozdormu. Final weapon choice of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands storyline. All three dragonflight branches feed The Might of Kalimdor. Jonathan is an AQ opening-event NPC; availability depends on the realm event. The raid does not require this chain once the gates are open."]="需要诺兹多姆的子嗣中立声望。流沙节杖剧情的最终武器选择。三条龙族分支均通往The Might of Kalimdor。乔纳森是AQ开门事件的NPC；能否接取取决于服务器的事件进度。大门开启后，团队副本不再需要此任务链。",
["Requires Neutral with Brood of Nozdormu. Historical AQ opening-event quest. The Black Qiraji Resonating Crystal is only awarded by ringing the Scarab Gong during the original server opening window (opening plus ten hours). It cannot be obtained from this quest after that event has ended. This is not required to enter an already-open AQ raid."]="需要诺兹多姆的子嗣中立声望。历史上的AQ开门事件任务。Black Qiraji Resonating Crystal只能在服务器最初的开门时段（开门后十小时内）敲响甲虫之锣获得。该事件结束后无法再通过此任务获得。进入已开放的AQ团队副本不需要此任务。",
