["Paladin class quest for humans and dwarves. In this dungeon: Jordan's Smithing Hammer is picked up from the object Jordan's Hammer in the courtyard. The other parts are Whitestone Oak Lumber (The Deadmines), the Kor Gem (Blackfathom Deeps) and Jordan's ore shipment (Loch Modan)."]="人類與矮人的聖騎士職業任務。在此地城中：Jordan's Smithing Hammer 從庭院中的 Jordan's Hammer 物件拾取。其他部件為 Whitestone Oak Lumber（死亡礦坑）、Kor Gem（黑暗深淵）以及喬丹的礦石貨物（洛克莫丹）。",
