["Repeatable hand-in; not a daily. Repeatable scepter-chain reputation hand-in. Completing The Path of the Righteous allows further Silithid Carapace Fragment turn-ins toward Neutral with the Brood of Nozdormu; these are not daily quests."]="可重複交付；非每日任務。權杖任務鏈的可重複聲望交付。完成「The Path of the Righteous」後，可繼續交付 Silithid Carapace Fragment，將諾茲多姆的子嗣聲望提升至中立；這些不是每日任務。",
["Repeatable hand-in; not a daily. Requires Blacksmithing 300 to use Plans: Sulfuron Hammer. The quest exchanges one Sulfuron Ingot from Golemagg for those plans. Sulfuras is made by combining a crafted Sulfuron Hammer with Eye of Sulfuras from Ragnaros; there is no separate Sulfuras reward quest."]="可重複交付；非每日任務。需要鍛造 300 才能使用 Plans: Sulfuron Hammer。此任務以一個古雷曼格掉落的 Sulfuron Ingot 兌換該設計圖。薩弗拉斯是由製作的 Sulfuron Hammer 與拉格納羅斯掉落的 Eye of Sulfuras 合成；沒有單獨的薩弗拉斯獎勵任務。",
["Repeatable hand-in; not a daily. Warrior/paladin weapon use. Plant Unfired Ancient Blade for Onyxia's frontal flame, pick up Heated Ancient Blade, then use it on her corpse within its time limit. Return Treated Ancient Blade to Lydros in the Athenaeum."]="可重複交付；非每日任務。供戰士/聖騎士武器使用。放置 Unfired Ancient Blade 承受奧妮克希亞的正面火焰吐息，拾取 Heated Ancient Blade，然後在時限內對她的屍體使用。將 Treated Ancient Blade 交還給圖書館的萊德羅斯。",
["Requires BOTH bindings, Essence of the Firelord from Ragnaros while on this quest, and 10 Elementium Bars. Elementium Ore comes from Blackwing Lair; have a miner learn Smelt Elementium from Krixix in BWL. Turn-in summons Thunderaan in Silithus."]="需要「兩個」束縛、在此任務期間從拉格納羅斯身上取得的 火焰之王的精華，以及 10 個 Elementium Bar。Elementium Ore 來自黑翼之巢；讓一名礦工在 BWL 向 Krixix 學習 Smelt Elementium。交付後會在希利蘇斯召喚桑德蘭。",
["Requires Exalted with Argent Dawn."]="需要銀色黎明崇拜聲望。",
["Requires Exalted with Argent Dawn. EXALTED alternative: free Arcane Cloaking, with no materials or gold. Complete only one reputation-based attunement."]="需要銀色黎明崇拜聲望。「崇拜」替代方案：免費取得 Arcane Cloaking，無需材料或金幣。只需完成一個依聲望而定的進入資格任務。",
["Requires Exalted with Brood of Nozdormu. Final Exalted Brood of Nozdormu ring for this path. Earlier Neutral/Friendly/Honored/Revered rings are in the chain. Choose one path; each upgrade consumes the preceding ring. The Changing of Paths quests are separate Exalted exchanges."]="需要諾茲多姆的子嗣崇拜聲望。此路線最終的崇拜級諾茲多姆的子嗣戒指。較早的中立/友好/尊敬/崇敬戒指都在任務鏈中。選擇一條路線；每次升級都會消耗前一枚戒指。「The Changing of Paths」任務是獨立的崇拜級兌換。",
["Requires Exalted with Brood of Nozdormu. Repeatable hand-in; not a daily. Exalted-only path reset. Surrender the ring and the listed scarabs to abandon this path, then begin a different ring path with Anachronos. This is not another automatic ring upgrade."]="需要諾茲多姆的子嗣崇拜聲望。可重複交付；非每日任務。僅限崇拜的路線重置。交出戒指和列出的聖甲蟲以放棄此路線，然後向安納克羅斯開始另一條戒指路線。這不是另一次自動戒指升級。",
["Requires Exalted with Cenarion Circle."]="需要塞納里奧議會崇拜聲望。",
["Requires Exalted with Zandalar Tribe."]="需要贊達拉部族崇拜聲望。",
