["Requires Friendly with Brood of Nozdormu. Repeatable hand-in; not a daily."]="需要諾茲多姆的子嗣友好聲望。可重複交付；非每日任務。",
["Requires Friendly with Zandalar Tribe."]="需要贊達拉部族友好聲望。",
