["Requires Honored with Argent Dawn. HONORED alternative: 5 Arcane Crystals, 2 Nexus Crystals, 1 Righteous Orb and 60 gold. Complete only one reputation-based attunement; the other versions are alternatives."]="需要銀色黎明尊敬聲望。「尊敬」替代方案：5 個 Arcane Crystal、2 個 Nexus Crystal、1 個 Righteous Orb 以及 60 金幣。只需完成一個依聲望而定的進入資格任務；其他版本為替代方案。",
["Requires Honored with Brood of Nozdormu."]="需要諾茲多姆的子嗣尊敬聲望。",
