["Requires the Barrens oasis quest chain. Complete The Barrens Oases, The Forgotten Pools, The Stagnant Oasis and Altered Beings, then Hamuul Runetotem and Nara Wildmane before Leaders of the Fang becomes available."]="需要貧瘠之地綠洲任務鏈。依序完成「The Barrens Oases」、「遺忘之池」、「死水綠洲」和「Altered Beings」，然後完成哈繆·符文圖騰與納拉·蠻鬃的任務，「Leaders of the Fang」才會出現。",
